家报告自 2026 年 8 月 4 日起升至 8%。此外，Account Health Rating 新规及包装限制提高了运营门槛，建议评估视频适配性与合规能力后再决定入驻。",{"_117":118},"2026-10-02T22:51:50.000Z",[133,115,149],44,{"_110":111,"_112":113},[176],{"_96":97,"_98":177,"_100":178,"_102":179,"_104":105,"_106":107,"_108":-5,"_109":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/cb62f5c3a1d96f62.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/cb62f5c3a1d96f62.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/cb62f5c3a1d96f62.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/cb62f5c3a1d96f62.webp 720w","y0iyp6qwjyehc20vnaqe9p8uu","Rothy’s、Caraway 与 Hanna Andersson 的 DTC 品牌差异化做法","原文以 Rothy’s、Caraway 和 Hanna Andersson 为例，讨论 DTC 品牌把自有网站视为多渠道之一、按自身条件加入亚马逊与零售渠道，并收紧产品与宣称的做法。Rothy’s 于 2024 年 5 月上线 Amazon Fashion；Hanna Andersson 据 Modern Retail 2026 年 9 月 29 日报道，以 90% 独家商品入驻亚马逊，以减少与官网的重叠，该文全文本站尚未独立核验。原文来自该机构，存在相关商业利益，并非独立测评。",{"_117":118},"2026-10-03T12:04:18.000Z","2026-10-09T06:34:20.412Z",[133,115,194,149],33,{"_110":111,"_112":113},[190],{"_96":97,"_98":191,"_100":192,"_102":193,"_104":105,"_106":107,"_108":-5,"_109":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/ece75bf1cf17c745.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/ece75bf1cf17c745.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/ece75bf1cf17c745.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/ece75bf1cf17c745.webp 720w","品牌","cf7t60y1gscv83z7opd2oktgu","TikTok 测试 TikTok Shop Plus 会员以对标 Amazon Prime","TikTok 在美国测试付费购物会员 TikTok Shop Plus，提供免运费、专属折扣等权益以增强用户留存。该功能旨在减少用户因物流优势转向 Amazon Prime，配合 FBT 及多渠道履约完善基础设施。GeekSeller 指出卖家已利用 TikTok 库存处理来自 Walmart、Amazon 等平台的订单，显示其正从发现渠道向综合销售与履约平台演进。",{"_117":211},"2026-10-04T21:11:43.000Z","2026-10-22T18:36:27.972Z",[210,115,149],42,{"_110":-5,"_112":209},[205],{"_96":97,"_98":206,"_100":207,"_102":208,"_104":-5,"_106":-5,"_108":-5,"_109":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/ff3c466222b1b2fa.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/ff3c466222b1b2fa.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/ff3c466222b1b2fa.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/ff3c466222b1b2fa.webp 720w","GeekSeller","行业动态","GeekSeller · 多平台卖家博客","ifl9hgr7of09eet7zfa488ify","亚马逊卖家顾问分享RA转OA经验","亚马逊卖家顾问 Jimmy Smith 分享从零售套利（RA）转向在线套利（OA）的经验，称 OA 更利于其生活平衡。他自述曾管理10余人团队做 RA，后改为仅需1名虚拟助理和自动系统的 OA 模式，虽利润率低于 RA 但更易规模化至月销10万美元以上。他认为 AI 是减少低效的工具而非捷径，实际执行者仍具优势。",{"_117":236},"2026-10-05T15:24:26.000Z","2026-10-17T16:14:18.331Z",[133,115,149],15,[],{"_222":223,"_224":225,"_226":227,"_228":229,"_92":230,"_231":232},"authorName","Jimmy Smith","handle","askjimmysmith","avatarUrl","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","avatarSrcSet","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 48w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 96w",[],"quoted",{"_222":223,"_224":225,"_233":234,"_235":-5},"text","If your Amazon business requires scanning barcodes in retail aisles every weekend, you built yourself a weekend shift.\n\nRunning through Target or Walmart with a phone scanner works to build some great profit margins, but real operational scale comes from online sourcing, automated Keepa filters, and replen systems that run whether you step foot in a store or not.\n\nBeing able to step away from store aisles without sales stopping is the whole point.","translation","X · Jimmy Smith","r1be42kgvsi0hwqahcyhwnchh","Eva CEO Hai Mag 解析亚马逊、TikTok Shop 与 Shopify 的扩张时机","Eva CEO Hai Mag 提出多平台扩张标准：先实现盈亏平衡，再增长，最后通过品牌搜索信号建立 Shopify 店铺。他指出约 65% 被审计卖家不清楚亚马逊实际利润，并强调需先算清含广告费的单品利润。Hai Mag 认为 TikTok Shop 用于产品发现，亚马逊负责销售速度，Shopify 用于留存客户，且启动亚马逊业务可能需约 $100K 资金。",{"_117":248},"2026-10-06T13:00:00.000Z","2026-10-06T14:06:23.002Z",[133,115,149],28,{"_110":247,"_112":248},[],"Nhan Dinh","Seller Labs","t601xtebm6fakas5req96aevp","卖家分享Prime促销期间的跨平台价格匹配经历","作者 SaulSellsStuff 在 X 上分享个人在 Prime 促销期间的采购经历：Prime 独家优惠无法用于 A2A，但许多商品在 Walmart 等零售商处有价格匹配；作者主要购买消耗品和玩具，并称自己购买了超过 1,000 包 Pur 口香糖，12 包装从 $35+ 降至 $10。作者还提到部分做 TikTok 直播的食品卖家加入了 FlipAlert，并称他们抓住了类似交易。以上均为作者个人自述，本站尚未独立核验。",{"_117":283},"2026-10-08T12:02:16.000Z","2026-10-17T15:58:17.541Z",[133,115],12,[],{"_222":259,"_224":260,"_226":261,"_228":262,"_92":263,"_231":264},"Saul","SaulSellsStuff","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 48w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 96w",[266,267,268],{"_222":259,"_224":260,"_233":265,"_235":-5},"Morning! \n\nI was asleep but it was a good day to be up early, or I suppose stay up late. \n\nCurrently seeing about 3x the deal volume so far with many retailer matches. \n\nHopefully Amazon can continue the pace and beat out previous sale days.",{"_96":97,"_98":279,"_100":280,"_102":281,"_104":277,"_106":282,"_108":-5,"_109":-5},{"_96":97,"_98":274,"_100":275,"_102":276,"_104":277,"_106":278,"_108":-5,"_109":-5},{"_96":97,"_98":269,"_100":270,"_102":271,"_104":272,"_106":273,"_108":-5,"_109":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 720w",1174,258,"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 720w",1320,457,"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 720w",1216,"X · Saul","el3n8dhw0w4ji20158kpuillw","TikTok Shop 2026年卖家运营完整指南：注册、费用与算法机制","Canopy Management发布《TikTok Shop 2026年卖家运营完整指南》，详解从Seller Center注册到内容运营的步骤。文章指出平台无月费，标准佣金为6%，但部分类目自2026年8月起可能升至8%。核心观点是TikTok依赖算法推荐而非搜索匹配，成功关键在于短视频与直播内容质量及创作者合作，并提及GMV Max广告工具与账户健康评分的影响。",{"_117":301},"2026-10-08T22:33:26.000Z","2026-10-09T05:26:52.777Z",[133,115,149],{"_110":299,"_112":300},[293],{"_96":97,"_98":294,"_100":295,"_102":296,"_104":297,"_106":298,"_108":-5,"_109":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/031692e94847bc17.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/031692e94847bc17.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/031692e94847bc17.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/031692e94847bc17.webp 720w",1152,648,"Chuck Kessler","Canopy Management","Canopy Management 亚马逊运营与广告文章","eg3h1o3spzb0cdg8kdgg343ln","Adobe Express 2026 调查：TikTok 搜索使用率升至 49%，但 Gen Z 偏好度降至 4%","Adobe Express 2026年2月调查显示，美国消费者在 TikTok 进行搜索的比例从 41% 升至 49%，但 Gen Z 中偏好 TikTok 而非 Google 的比例从 8% 降至 4%。该机构自报样本较小且未公布误差范围，数据仅作为趋势信号；Reddit 和 ChatGPT 正成为购买前的主要核查渠道，品牌需适应多平台碎片化的产品发现路径。",{"_117":118},"2026-10-09T09:12:00.000Z","2026-10-09T17:48:22.146Z",[133,115,316],37,{"_110":111,"_112":113},[312],{"_96":97,"_98":313,"_100":314,"_102":315,"_104":105,"_106":107,"_108":-5,"_109":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/569fa8d0b278d322.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/569fa8d0b278d322.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/569fa8d0b278d322.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/569fa8d0b278d322.webp 720w","品类趋势","axg2levy53vrfd3ohrbeft5q8","商务部电子商务司负责人解读品质电商“五优”行动通知","商务部电子商务司负责人解读《关于实施品质电商“五优”行动的通知》，明确围绕推优、创优、择优、争优、护优五大维度部署15项具体工作。该行动旨在推动电商从规模扩张向质量提升转型，涵盖平台规则优化、商家品牌创新、消费场景融合及丝路电商出海等全链条培育体系。",{"_117":327},"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","2026-10-17T05:16:21.099Z",[114,115,194],{"_110":-5,"_112":326},[],"商务部","商务部 · 新闻发布","anxl9qp7mrvelizn9vxw00y88","Shopify 代运营与内部团队选择指南：何时雇佣哪种模式","当 Shopify 是主要渠道且工作稳定时建议组建内部团队，若需多项专业技能或跨渠道协同则适合外包。多数成长型品牌采用混合模式，由内部负责人决策、外部机构执行专业工作。",{"_117":340},"2026-10-10T23:24:23.000Z","2026-10-10T23:42:34.269Z",[133,115,149],17,{"_110":338,"_112":339},[],"Hai Mag","Eva Commerce","Eva Commerce · Hai Mag","ii98vm85cvuzjjadh2s8v7xs3","Shopify 店铺 Meta 广告设置、测量与常见错误指南","为 Shopify 店铺运行 Meta 广告，需连接官方销售渠道、配置单一像素并将数据共享设为 Enhanced 或 Maximum 以启用 Conversions API。由于归因窗口和去重机制差异，Meta 报告数据常与 Shopify 订单不符，建议结合 UTM 标记、混合效率及增量测试进行综合评估。",{"_117":340},"2026-10-10T23:24:24.000Z",[133,134,115],24,{"_110":338,"_112":339},[],"fvmheksl6s7r8uwt6sskoge70","Helium 10 播客探讨联盟营销增收策略及自家佣金计划","Helium 10 在 Serious Sellers Podcast 第769期介绍利用联盟营销为亚马逊、Shopify 和 TikTok Shop 卖家增加收入，并推广其自家联盟计划。",{"_117":365},"2026-10-12T21:43:34.000Z","2026-10-12T22:10:31.417Z",[133,115,194],{"_110":363,"_112":364},[359],{"_96":97,"_98":360,"_100":361,"_102":362,"_104":-5,"_106":-5,"_108":-5,"_109":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/